---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { treatments } from "../../data/treatments";
export function getStaticPaths(){return treatments.map(item=>({params:{treatment:item.slug},props:{item}}))}
const {item}=Astro.props;
---
<SiteLayout title={item.title} description={item.description} active="treatments" plainHead={true}>
<section class="section wrap treatment-detail"><div class="treatment-main"><img class="treatment-photo" src={`/images/stock/${item.image}.webp`} alt={item.alt} width="1000" height="650" fetchpriority="high"/><section id="overview"><h2>项目介绍</h2><p>{item.summary}</p><h3>可以带着这些问题来咨询</h3><ul>{item.consult.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ul></section><section id="steps"><h2>主要环节</h2><ol>{item.stages.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ol><a class="inline-link" href="/process/">查看每个阶段的准备事项与结果</a></section><section id="costs"><h2>费用包含什么</h2><p class="treatment-price">{item.price}</p><dl class="service-scope"><div><dt>基础范围</dt><dd>{item.included}</dd></div><div><dt>另计项目</dt><dd>{item.excluded}</dd></div></dl><p class="caption">参考预算，以接诊机构评估后的书面报价为准。</p><a class="inline-link" href="/fees/">组合费用项目，计算参考预算</a></section><section id="prepare"><h2>初诊前准备</h2><p>整理已有报告、既往治疗与用药记录，注明检查日期；尚未做检查可以先联系，不必自行补齐一整套检查。</p><h3>建议向医生确认</h3><ul>{item.questions.map(text=><li>{text}</li>)}</ul><a class="inline-link" href={item.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener">医学资料：HFEA患者指南</a></section></div><aside class="treatment-aside"><h2>初诊与预约</h2><p>先确认咨询方式、资料清单与咨询费用，再安排医生评估。</p><a class="button" href={`/contact/?topic=${encodeURIComponent(item.title)}`}>咨询这个项目</a><nav aria-label="本页内容"><a href="#overview">项目介绍</a><a href="#steps">主要环节</a><a href="#costs">费用范围</a><a href="#prepare">初诊准备</a></nav><a class="inline-link" href="/treatments/">比较其他治疗项目</a></aside></section></SiteLayout>
